" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d5bea0f5-9e1e-48fc-88cc-5c8abf0c6cc1\" />\n\n关于您说的一次对话消耗100个、80个，这个是根据您当前会话的上下文决定的，您如果进行了多轮对话，ai需要消耗更多token哈，建议您做上下文管理，新开对话使用\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/3888495687/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/3979394985","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2228#issuecomment-3979394985","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2228","id":3979394985,"node_id":"IC_kwDONiYvnc7tML-p","user":{"login":"boychina","id":20528499,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNTI4NDk5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20528499?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/boychina","html_url":"https://github.com/boychina","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boychina/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boychina/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boychina/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boychina/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boychina/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boychina/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boychina/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boychina/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boychina/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-01T07:23:44Z","updated_at":"2026-03-01T07:23:44Z","body":"我遇到的问题是由于模型出现了一定的问题导致死循环，对于同一个文件出现不断地写入一行代码、删除一行代码。\n这种情况下如果我没有手动结束请求就会不断消耗cost。\n\n现在切换到了Dollar Usage模式，不清楚这种情况还会不会再次出现。\n\n感谢建议，后面确实要进行上下文和对话管理。","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae